{"id": "44851cfb-b8b6-46a9-93a7-47505b3782df", "slug": "nexus-framework", "title": "Nexus / Framework", "description": "Nexus Framework Dashboard Section is designed for demonstrating application workflows and interface hierarchy. Key features include clear information density, modular panels, and interface rhythm. It is suitable for product showcases, admin panels, and analytics experiences.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-staff-featured-2026-05-22\"\nname: \"Nexus / Framework\"\ndescription: \"Nexus Framework Dashboard Section is designed for demonstrating application workflows and interface hierarchy. Key features include clear information density, modular panels, and interface rhythm. It is suitable for product showcases, admin panels, and analytics experiences.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#E6A24A\"\n  secondary: \"#F4F1E8\"\n  accent: \"#4DA3FF\"\n  background: \"#03070B\"\n  surface: \"#F4F1E8\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#27272A\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Space Grotesk\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"IBM Plex Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"IBM Plex Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"8px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Nexus / Framework\nSource: Neuform staff featured templates. Author: Samnang Aing (@samnang). Views: 88; favorites: 5; remixes: 2.\nTags: dashboard, animated, webgl, threejs, dither, charts, support, flow.\n## Overview\nNexus Framework Dashboard Section is designed for demonstrating application workflows and interface hierarchy. Key features include clear information density, modular panels, and interface rhythm. It is suitable for product showcases, admin panels, and analytics experiences.\n\n[ COORD_SEC ] · v2.4.9 Live Ingress Architecture Compiled at the Boundary. Dissolving the friction between raw ambition and immutable deployment. Structural telemetry maps bounds before they break. Dither_Map XZ_PLANE R…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Architecture Compiled at the Boundary..\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #E6A24A, secondary #F4F1E8, accent #4DA3FF, background #03070B, surface #F4F1E8, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Space Grotesk for display moments and IBM Plex Mono for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use IBM Plex Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nDashboard, chart, and data panels should preserve their compact operational hierarchy, nested surfaces, and metric emphasis.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Nexus / Quantum Logistics Command</title>\n\n  <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n  <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n  <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.5/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n  <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/three.js/r128/three.min.js\"></script>\n\n  <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Space+Grotesk:wght@300;400;500;600&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@300;400;500&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n\n<body\n  class=\"min-h-screen bg-[#03070B] text-[#F4F1E8] antialiased overflow-x-hidden selection:bg-[#E6A24A] selection:text-[#03070B]\"\n  style=\"font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;\"\n>\n\n  <!-- Atmospheric Background -->\n  <div\n    class=\"fixed inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none\"\n    style=\"\n      background:\n        radial-gradient(circle at 20% 12%, rgba(77, 163, 255, 0.12), transparent 28%),\n        radial-gradient(circle at 82% 72%, rgba(230, 162, 74, 0.10), transparent 30%),\n        linear-gradient(135deg, #03070B 0%, #050A10 42%, #020508 100%);\n    \"\n  ></div>\n\n  <!-- Technical Route Grid -->\n  <div\n    class=\"fixed inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none opacity-70\"\n    style=\"\n      background-image:\n        linear-gradient(rgba(244, 241, 232, 0.035) 1px, transparent 1px),\n        linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(244, 241, 232, 0.035) 1px, transparent 1px),\n        repeating-linear-gradient(45deg, transparent, transparent 34px, rgba(230, 162, 74, 0.025) 34px, rgba(230, 162, 74, 0.025) 35px);\n      background-size: 48px 48px, 48px 48px, auto;\n      mask-image: radial-gradient(circle at center, black 0%, black 55%, transparent 100%);\n      -webkit-mask-image: radial-gradient(circle at center, black 0%, black 55%, transparent 100%);\n    \"\n  ></div>\n\n  <!-- Soft Top Glow -->\n  <div\n    class=\"fixed inset-x-0 top-0 h-[45vh] z-0 pointer-events-none\"\n    style=\"\n      background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(77, 163, 255, 0.08), transparent);\n    \"\n  ></div>\n\n  <!-- Progressive Blur Bottom -->\n  <div class=\"fixed z-50 pointer-events-none\" style=\"inset: auto 0 0 0; height: 15%;\">\n    <div class=\"absolute inset-0\" style=\"z-index: 1; backdrop-filter: blur(0.5px); -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(0.5px); mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0) 0%, rgba(0,0,0,1) 12.5%, rgba(0,0,0,1) 25%, rgba(0,0,0,0) 37.5%); -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0) 0%, rgba(0,0,0,1) 12.5%, rgba(0,0,0,1) 25%, rgba(0,0,0,0) 37.5%);\"></div>\n    <div class=\"absolute inset-0\" style=\"z-index: 2; backdrop-filter: blur(1px); -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(1px); mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0) 12.5%, rgba(0,0,0,1) 25%, rgba(0,0,0,1) 37.5%, rgba(0,0,0,0) 50%); -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0) 12.5%, rgba(0,0,0,1) 25%, rgba(0,0,0,1) 37.5%, rgba(0,0,0,0) 50%);\"></div>\n    <div class=\"absolute inset-0\" style=\"z-index: 3; backdrop-filter: blur(2px); -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(2px); mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0) 25%, rgba(0,0,0,1) 37.5%, rgba(0,0,0,1) 50%, rgba(0,0,0,0) 62.5%); -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0) 25%, rgba(0,0,0,1) 37.5%, rgba(0,0,0,1) 50%, rgba(0,0,0,0) 62.5%);\"></div>\n    <div class=\"absolute inset-0\" style=\"z-index: 4; backdrop-filter: blur(4px); -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(4px); mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0) 37.5%, rgba(0,0,0,1) 50%, rgba(0,0,0,1) 62.5%, rgba(0,0,0,0) 75%); -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0) 37.5%, rgba(0,0,0,1) 50%, rgba(0,0,0,1) 62.5%, rgba(0,0,0,0) 75%);\"></div>\n    <div class=\"absolute inset-0\" style=\"z-index: 5; backdrop-filter: blur(8px); -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(8px); mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0) 50%, rgba(0,0,0,1) 62.5%, rgba(0,0,0,1) 75%, rgba(0,0,0,0) 87.5%); -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0) 50%, rgba(0,0,0,1) 62.5%, rgba(0,0,0,1) 75%, rgba(0,0,0,0) 87.5%);\"></div>\n    <div class=\"absolute inset-0\" style=\"z-index: 6; backdrop-filter: blur(16px); -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px); mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0) 62.5%, rgba(0,0,0,1) 75%, rgba(0,0,0,1) 87.5%, rgba(0,0,0,0) 100%); -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0) 62.5%, rgba(0,0,0,1) 75%, rgba(0,0,0,1) 87.5%, rgba(0,0,0,0) 100%);\"></div>\n    <div class=\"absolute inset-0\" style=\"z-index: 7; backdrop-filter: blur(32px); -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(32px); mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0) 75%, rgba(0,0,0,1) 87.5%, rgba(0,0,0,1) 100%); -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0) 75%, rgba(0,0,0,1) 87.5%, rgba(0,0,0,1) 100%);\"></div>\n    <div class=\"absolute inset-0\" style=\"z-index: 8; backdrop-filter: blur(64px); -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(64px); mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0) 87.5%, rgba(0,0,0,1) 100%); -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0) 87.5%, rgba(0,0,0,1) 100%);\"></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Outer Framed Shell -->\n  <div class=\"max-w-[1440px] mx-auto min-h-screen relative flex flex-col lg:flex-row shadow-2xl\">\n\n    <!-- Main Container Borders -->\n    <div\n      class=\"absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none z-20 border-x\"\n      style=\"\n        border-color: rgba(244, 241, 232, 0.10);\n        border-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(244,241,232,0.20), rgba(244,241,232,0.03)) 1;\n      \"\n    >\n      <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-4 h-4 border-t border-l -translate-x-[1px] -translate-y-[1px]\" style=\"border-color: rgba(230,162,74,0.65);\"></div>\n      <div class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-4 h-4 border-t border-r translate-x-[1px] -translate-y-[1px]\" style=\"border-color: rgba(77,163,255,0.55);\"></div>\n      <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-4 h-4 border-b border-l -translate-x-[1px] translate-y-[1px]\" style=\"border-color: rgba(77,163,255,0.45);\"></div>\n      <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-4 h-4 border-b border-r translate-x-[1px] translate-y-[1px]\" style=\"border-color: rgba(230,162,74,0.55);\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- LEFT PANEL -->\n    <section\n      class=\"flex-1 lg:w-1/2 flex flex-col relative z-10 border-b lg:border-b-0 lg:border-r backdrop-blur-xl overflow-hidden\"\n      style=\"\n        background:\n          linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(7,16,24,0.82), rgba(2,5,8,0.92)),\n          radial-gradient(circle at 20% 20%, rgba(230,162,74,0.08), transparent 35%);\n        border-color: rgba(244, 241, 232, 0.10);\n        border-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(244,241,232,0.18), rgba(244,241,232,0.03)) 1;\n      \"\n    >\n\n      <!-- Left Panel Accent Lines -->\n      <div\n        class=\"absolute left-0 top-0 bottom-0 w-px pointer-events-none\"\n        style=\"background: linear-gradient(to bottom, transparent, rgba(230,162,74,0.45), transparent);\"\n      ></div>\n\n      <div\n        class=\"absolute inset-x-0 top-0 h-px pointer-events-none\"\n        style=\"background: linear-gradient(to right, transparent, rgba(230,162,74,0.45), rgba(77,163,255,0.35), transparent);\"\n      ></div>\n\n      <!-- Top Rail -->\n      <header class=\"p-8 lg:p-20 xl:p-24 flex items-center justify-between pb-0 shrink-0\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 text-[#F4F1E8]/55\" style=\"font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;\">\n          <div\n            class=\"w-7 h-7 border flex items-center justify-center\"\n            style=\"border-color: rgba(230,162,74,0.25); background: rgba(230,162,74,0.05);\"\n          >\n            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:route-linear\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" class=\"text-[#E6A24A] text-base\"></iconify-icon>\n          </div>\n          <span class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.24em]\">[ ROUTE_SEC ]</span>\n          <span class=\"text-xs hidden md:inline text-[#F4F1E8]/30\">·</span>\n          <span class=\"text-xs hidden md:inline tracking-[0.24em] text-[#F4F1E8]/30\">v4.8.2</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"hidden sm:flex items-center gap-2\" style=\"font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;\">\n          <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7FC89A] shadow-[0_0_14px_rgba(127,200,154,0.7)]\"></span>\n          <span class=\"text-xs text-[#F4F1E8]/40 uppercase tracking-[0.2em]\">Online</span>\n        </div>\n      </header>\n\n      <!-- Hero Content -->\n      <div class=\"p-8 lg:p-20 xl:p-24 flex-grow flex flex-col justify-center\">\n\n        <div class=\"mb-6 flex items-center gap-3\" style=\"font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;\">\n          <div class=\"relative w-2 h-2\">\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[#E6A24A] animate-pulse\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-[-6px] border border-[#E6A24A]/20\"></div>\n          </div>\n          <span class=\"text-xs text-[#E6A24A] tracking-[0.24em] uppercase\">Route Sync Active</span>\n          <div class=\"h-px w-14 bg-[#E6A24A]/30 ml-2\"></div>\n        </div>\n\n        <h1 class=\"text-[3.1rem] sm:text-6xl lg:text-6xl xl:text-7xl font-light tracking-[-0.07em] leading-[0.86] text-[#F4F1E8] overflow-hidden mb-8\">\n          <span class=\"inline-block overflow-hidden pb-1\">\n            <span class=\"gsap-reveal inline-block translate-y-full\">Every route</span>\n          </span><br/>\n          <span class=\"inline-block overflow-hidden pb-1\">\n            <span class=\"gsap-reveal inline-block translate-y-full\">resolved before</span>\n          </span><br/>\n          <span class=\"inline-block overflow-hidden pb-1\">\n            <span class=\"gsap-reveal inline-block translate-y-full text-[#F4F1E8]/42\">collision.</span>\n          </span>\n        </h1>\n\n        <p class=\"text-[15px] font-light leading-relaxed text-[#F4F1E8]/52 max-w-md overflow-hidden mb-10\">\n          <span class=\"gsap-reveal inline-block translate-y-full\">\n            Autonomous cargo, fleet telemetry, and route intelligence synchronized across moving infrastructure before delays become failures.\n          </span>\n        </p>\n\n        <!-- Micro Stats Row -->\n        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-3 gap-px mb-12 bg-[#F4F1E8]/10 border border-[#F4F1E8]/10 max-w-md\">\n          <div class=\"bg-[#071018]/90 px-4 py-3\">\n            <div class=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#F4F1E8]/32 mb-1\" style=\"font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;\">Routes</div>\n            <div class=\"text-lg tracking-tight text-[#F4F1E8]\">1,284</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"bg-[#071018]/90 px-4 py-3\">\n            <div class=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#F4F1E8]/32 mb-1\" style=\"font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;\">Nodes</div>\n            <div class=\"text-lg tracking-tight text-[#4DA3FF]\">64</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"bg-[#071018]/90 px-4 py-3\">\n            <div class=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#F4F1E8]/32 mb-1\" style=\"font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;\">Drift</div>\n            <div class=\"text-lg tracking-tight text-[#E6A24A]\">0.08°</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Premium Embedded Surface: WebGL Window -->\n        <div\n          class=\"relative w-full aspect-video lg:aspect-square p-1 border overflow-hidden shadow-2xl\"\n          style=\"\n            background:\n              linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(244,241,232,0.05), rgba(244,241,232,0.01)),\n              #020508;\n            border-color: rgba(244, 241, 232, 0.12);\n            border-image: linear-gradient(to bottom right, rgba(230,162,74,0.35), rgba(77,163,255,0.18), rgba(244,241,232,0.03)) 1;\n            box-shadow:\n              0 40px 100px rgba(0,0,0,0.45),\n              inset 0 1px 0 rgba(244,241,232,0.05);\n          \"\n        >\n\n          <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-3 h-3 border-t border-l -translate-x-[1px] -translate-y-[1px] z-10\" style=\"border-color: rgba(230,162,74,0.6);\"></div>\n          <div class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-3 h-3 border-t border-r translate-x-[1px] -translate-y-[1px] z-10\" style=\"border-color: rgba(77,163,255,0.45);\"></div>\n          <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-3 h-3 border-b border-l -translate-x-[1px] translate-y-[1px] z-10\" style=\"border-color: rgba(77,163,255,0.35);\"></div>\n          <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-3 h-3 border-b border-r translate-x-[1px] translate-y-[1px] z-10\" style=\"border-color: rgba(230,162,74,0.45);\"></div>\n\n          <!-- Inner Route Overlay -->\n          <div\n            class=\"absolute inset-0 z-10 pointer-events-none opacity-70\"\n            style=\"\n              background:\n                linear-gradient(rgba(244,241,232,0.025) 1px, transparent 1px),\n                linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(244,241,232,0.025) 1px, transparent 1px);\n              background-size: 32px 32px;\n              mask-image: radial-gradient(circle at center, black 0%, transparent 80%);\n              -webkit-mask-image: radial-gradient(circle at center, black 0%, transparent 80%);\n            \"\n          ></div>\n\n          <div class=\"absolute inset-4 z-20 pointer-events-none flex flex-col justify-between\">\n            <div class=\"flex justify-between items-start\" style=\"font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;\">\n              <div>\n                <span class=\"block text-xs text-[#F4F1E8]/44 uppercase tracking-[0.22em]\">Cargo_Field</span>\n                <span class=\"block text-[10px] text-[#E6A24A]/55 uppercase tracking-[0.18em] mt-1\">Predictive mesh</span>\n              </div>\n              <span class=\"text-xs text-[#F4F1E8]/24\">XZ_ROUTE_PLANE</span>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\" style=\"font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;\">\n              <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:radar-2-linear\" class=\"text-[#4DA3FF] text-sm\"></iconify-icon>\n                <span class=\"text-xs text-[#F4F1E8]/44 uppercase tracking-[0.22em]\">Scanning</span>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-[#E6A24A] animate-pulse\"></span>\n                <span class=\"text-xs text-[#E6A24A]/80 uppercase tracking-[0.22em]\">Live</span>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- WebGL Target Container -->\n          <div id=\"webgl-container\" class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full mix-blend-screen\"></div>\n        </div>\n\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- RIGHT PANEL -->\n    <section\n      class=\"flex-1 lg:w-1/2 flex flex-col relative z-10 backdrop-blur-md overflow-hidden\"\n      style=\"\n        background:\n          linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(3,7,11,0.92), rgba(2,5,8,0.96)),\n          radial-gradient(circle at 80% 20%, rgba(77,163,255,0.07), transparent 34%);\n      \"\n    >\n\n      <div\n        class=\"absolute inset-y-0 left-0 w-px pointer-events-none\"\n        style=\"background: linear-gradient(to bottom, transparent, rgba(244,241,232,0.10), transparent);\"\n      ></div>\n\n      <!-- Right Top Rail -->\n      <header class=\"p-8 lg:p-20 xl:p-24 flex items-center justify-between pb-0 shrink-0 border-t lg:border-t-0 border-[#F4F1E8]/10 lg:border-transparent\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 text-[#F4F1E8]/52\" style=\"font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;\">\n          <span class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.24em]\">[ DISPATCH CONTROL ]</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <button\n          class=\"group flex items-center gap-2 border px-4 py-2 transition-all backdrop-blur-md\"\n          style=\"\n            background: rgba(230,162,74,0.08);\n            border-color: rgba(230,162,74,0.25);\n            box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 rgba(244,241,232,0.05);\n          \"\n        >\n          <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:play-linear\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" class=\"text-[#E6A24A] text-sm group-hover:translate-x-0.5 transition-transform\"></iconify-icon>\n          <span class=\"text-xs font-normal text-[#F4F1E8] uppercase tracking-[0.22em]\" style=\"font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;\">Route Plan</span>\n        </button>\n      </header>\n\n      <!-- Specifications Area -->\n      <div class=\"p-8 lg:p-20 xl:p-24 flex-grow flex flex-col pt-12 lg:pt-24\">\n\n        <!-- Data Grid -->\n        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-px bg-[#F4F1E8]/10 border border-[#F4F1E8]/10 mb-10 shadow-2xl\">\n\n          <!-- Spec Cell -->\n          <div\n            class=\"p-6 relative overflow-hidden\"\n            style=\"background: linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(7,16,24,0.98), rgba(2,5,8,0.98));\"\n          >\n            <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 right-0 h-px bg-[#E6A24A]/25\"></div>\n            <div class=\"text-xs text-[#F4F1E8]/38 mb-2 uppercase tracking-[0.22em]\" style=\"font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;\">Fleet.State</div>\n            <div class=\"text-lg font-light tracking-tight text-[#F4F1E8] flex items-center gap-2\">\n              Syncing\n              <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:refresh-linear\" class=\"text-[#4DA3FF]/70 text-base animate-spin\"></iconify-icon>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Spec Cell -->\n          <div\n            class=\"p-6 relative overflow-hidden\"\n            style=\"background: linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(7,16,24,0.98), rgba(2,5,8,0.98));\"\n          >\n            <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 right-0 h-px bg-[#4DA3FF]/20\"></div>\n            <div class=\"text-xs text-[#F4F1E8]/38 mb-2 uppercase tracking-[0.22em]\" style=\"font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;\">Route Delay</div>\n            <div class=\"text-lg font-light tracking-tight text-[#E6A24A]\">\n              12<span class=\"text-sm text-[#E6A24A]/50 ml-1\">ms</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Spec Cell -->\n          <div\n            class=\"p-6 relative overflow-hidden\"\n            style=\"background: linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(7,16,24,0.98), rgba(2,5,8,0.98));\"\n          >\n            <div class=\"text-xs text-[#F4F1E8]/38 mb-2 uppercase tracking-[0.22em]\" style=\"font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;\">Cargo Flow</div>\n            <div class=\"text-lg font-light tracking-tight text-[#F4F1E8]\">\n              8.4<span class=\"text-sm text-[#F4F1E8]/40 ml-1\">M/s</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Spec Cell -->\n          <div\n            class=\"p-6 flex flex-col justify-center relative overflow-hidden\"\n            style=\"background: linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(7,16,24,0.98), rgba(2,5,8,0.98));\"\n          >\n            <div class=\"w-full bg-[#F4F1E8]/7 h-1.5 overflow-hidden flex\">\n              <div class=\"h-full bg-[#4DA3FF]/65 w-[52%]\"></div>\n              <div class=\"h-full bg-[#E6A24A] w-[18%]\"></div>\n              <div class=\"h-full bg-[#FF5C45]/75 w-[5%]\"></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"flex justify-between mt-2 text-xs\" style=\"font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;\">\n              <span class=\"text-[#F4F1E8]/38 tracking-[0.22em]\">LOAD</span>\n              <span class=\"text-[#F4F1E8]/80\">75%</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Dispatch Mode -->\n        <div class=\"mb-10\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-[#F4F1E8]/10 pb-5\">\n            <span class=\"text-xs text-[#F4F1E8]/50 uppercase tracking-[0.24em]\" style=\"font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;\">Dispatch Mode</span>\n\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n              <span class=\"text-xs text-[#F4F1E8]/30\" style=\"font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;\">LOCAL</span>\n\n              <!-- Custom Toggle -->\n              <div\n                class=\"relative w-14 h-6 border cursor-pointer shadow-inner\"\n                style=\"background: rgba(2,5,8,0.95); border-color: rgba(244,241,232,0.16);\"\n              >\n                <div\n                  class=\"absolute top-[2px] right-[2px] w-6 h-[18px] flex items-center justify-center shadow-md\"\n                  style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #E6A24A, #F3C77B);\"\n                >\n                  <div class=\"w-[1px] h-2 bg-[#03070B]/35 mx-px\"></div>\n                  <div class=\"w-[1px] h-2 bg-[#03070B]/35 mx-px\"></div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n\n              <span class=\"text-xs text-[#E6A24A]\" style=\"font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;\">GLOBAL</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Route Stack -->\n        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-3 gap-px bg-[#F4F1E8]/10 border border-[#F4F1E8]/10 mb-10\">\n          <div class=\"bg-[#071018]/80 p-4\">\n            <div class=\"text-[10px] text-[#F4F1E8]/34 uppercase tracking-[0.2em] mb-2\" style=\"font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;\">North Hub</div>\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n              <div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-[#7FC89A]\"></div>\n              <span class=\"text-sm text-[#F4F1E8]/82\">Stable</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"bg-[#071018]/80 p-4\">\n            <div class=\"text-[10px] text-[#F4F1E8]/34 uppercase tracking-[0.2em] mb-2\" style=\"font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;\">West Lane</div>\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n              <div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-[#E6A24A]\"></div>\n              <span class=\"text-sm text-[#F4F1E8]/82\">Reroute</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"bg-[#071018]/80 p-4\">\n            <div class=\"text-[10px] text-[#F4F1E8]/34 uppercase tracking-[0.2em] mb-2\" style=\"font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;\">Port Link</div>\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n              <div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-[#4DA3FF]\"></div>\n              <span class=\"text-sm text-[#F4F1E8]/82\">Locked</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Terminal Logs -->\n        <div\n          class=\"flex-grow min-h-[230px] border bg-[#020508] p-1 relative shadow-inner\"\n          style=\"\n            border-color: rgba(244, 241, 232, 0.10);\n            border-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(244,241,232,0.12), rgba(244,241,232,0.03)) 1;\n            box-shadow:\n              inset 0 1px 0 rgba(244,241,232,0.03),\n              0 30px 80px rgba(0,0,0,0.35);\n          \"\n        >\n          <div\n            class=\"h-full w-full p-6 text-xs text-[#F4F1E8]/58 leading-loose overflow-hidden\"\n            style=\"\n              font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;\n              background:\n                linear-gradient(rgba(244,241,232,0.018) 1px, transparent 1px),\n                #03070B;\n              background-size: 100% 28px;\n            \"\n          >\n            <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-4 pb-2 border-b border-[#F4F1E8]/6\">\n              <span class=\"text-[#F4F1E8]/34 tracking-[0.24em] uppercase\">Dispatch.log</span>\n              <span class=\"text-[#F4F1E8]/28\">tail -f /route-mesh</span>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"gsap-log opacity-0 translate-y-2\">\n              <span class=\"text-[#E6A24A] mr-2\">›</span>\n              loading freight corridor matrix ... <span class=\"text-[#F4F1E8]\">ok</span>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"gsap-log opacity-0 translate-y-2\">\n              <span class=\"text-[#E6A24A] mr-2\">›</span>\n              resolving autonomous convoy lanes ... <span class=\"text-[#4DA3FF]\">12ms</span>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"gsap-log opacity-0 translate-y-2\">\n              <span class=\"text-[#E6A24A] mr-2\">›</span>\n              validating port-side signal integrity ... <span class=\"text-[#F4F1E8]\">verified</span>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"gsap-log opacity-0 translate-y-2\">\n              <span class=\"text-[#E6A24A] mr-2\">›</span>\n              rerouting west-lane cargo around congestion node\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"gsap-log opacity-0 translate-y-2\">\n              <span class=\"text-[#4DA3FF] mr-2\">›</span>\n              predictive collision window reduced ... <span class=\"text-[#F4F1E8]\">0.08°</span>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"gsap-log opacity-0 translate-y-2 text-[#F4F1E8]/34 mt-2\">\n              <span class=\"text-[#E6A24A] mr-2\">›</span>\n              global dispatch ready<span class=\"inline-block w-2 h-3 bg-[#E6A24A]/70 ml-1 align-middle animate-pulse\"></span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n  </div>\n\n  <script>\n    // GSAP Animations\n    document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", () => {\n      gsap.to(\".gsap-reveal\", {\n        y: \"0%\",\n        ease: \"power3.out\",\n        duration: 1.2,\n        stagger: 0.1,\n        delay: 0.15\n      });\n\n      gsap.to(\".gsap-log\", {\n        y: 0,\n        opacity: 1,\n        ease: \"power2.out\",\n        duration: 0.8,\n        stagger: 0.14,\n        delay: 0.95\n      });\n    });\n\n    // Three.js WebGL Setup - Predictive Route Columns\n    const container = document.getElementById('webgl-container');\n\n    if (container) {\n      const scene = new THREE.Scene();\n\n      const camera = new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(\n        35,\n        container.clientWidth / container.clientHeight,\n        0.1,\n        100\n      );\n\n      camera.position.set(20, 15, 20);\n      camera.lookAt(0, 5, 0);\n\n      const renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({\n        antialias: false,\n        alpha: true\n      });\n\n      renderer.setSize(container.clientWidth, container.clientHeight);\n      renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio, 2));\n      container.appendChild(renderer.domElement);\n\n      // Shader Material - amber/blue logistics signal field\n      const columnMaterial = new THREE.ShaderMaterial({\n        uniforms: {\n          uTime: { value: 0 }\n        },\n        vertexShader: `\n          varying vec2 vUv;\n          varying vec3 vPos;\n\n          void main() {\n            vUv = uv;\n            vPos = position;\n            gl_Position = projectionMatrix * modelViewMatrix * vec4(position, 1.0);\n          }\n        `,\n        fragmentShader: `\n          varying vec2 vUv;\n          varying vec3 vPos;\n          uniform float uTime;\n\n          float random(vec2 st) {\n            return fract(sin(dot(st.xy, vec2(12.9898,78.233))) * 43758.5453123);\n          }\n\n          void main() {\n            float grain = random(gl_FragCoord.xy + uTime) * 0.055;\n\n            vec3 base = vec3(0.035, 0.07, 0.095);\n            vec3 amber = vec3(0.902, 0.635, 0.290);\n            vec3 blue = vec3(0.302, 0.639, 1.0);\n            vec3 ivory = vec3(0.957, 0.945, 0.910);\n\n            float layer = step(0.56, fract((vPos.y + uTime * 1.4) * 3.2 + grain));\n            float routePulse = smoothstep(0.92, 1.0, sin(vPos.y * 1.9 - uTime * 2.5));\n            float signalPulse = smoothstep(0.96, 1.0, sin((vPos.x + vPos.y) * 1.7 + uTime * 2.2));\n\n            vec3 color = base;\n            color += vec3(layer * 0.07);\n            color = mix(color, amber, routePulse * 0.38);\n            color = mix(color, blue, signalPulse * 0.24);\n            color = mix(color, ivory, smoothstep(0.95, 1.0, vUv.y) * 0.06);\n\n            color -= grain;\n\n            gl_FragColor = vec4(color, 1.0);\n          }\n        `,\n        transparent: true\n      });\n\n      // Group of route columns\n      const group = new THREE.Group();\n      const gridSize = 8;\n      const spacing = 1.22;\n\n      for (let i = 0; i < gridSize; i++) {\n        for (let j = 0; j < gridSize; j++) {\n          const distanceFromCenter = Math.sqrt(\n            Math.pow(i - gridSize / 2, 2) + Math.pow(j - gridSize / 2, 2)\n          );\n\n          const height =\n            Math.random() * 5 +\n            2 +\n            Math.max(0, 4 - distanceFromCenter) * 0.8;\n\n          const geometry = new THREE.BoxGeometry(0.76, height, 0.76);\n          geometry.translate(0, height / 2, 0);\n\n          const mesh = new THREE.Mesh(geometry, columnMaterial);\n\n          mesh.position.x = (i - gridSize / 2) * spacing;\n          mesh.position.z = (j - gridSize / 2) * spacing;\n\n          mesh.userData = {\n            phase: Math.random() * Math.PI * 2,\n            speed: Math.random() * 0.38 + 0.16,\n            baseHeight: height\n          };\n\n          group.add(mesh);\n        }\n      }\n\n      scene.add(group);\n\n      // Route line material\n      const routeMaterial = new THREE.LineBasicMaterial({\n        color: 0xE6A24A,\n        transparent: true,\n        opacity: 0.22\n      });\n\n      // Add a few horizontal route paths across the field\n      for (let r = 0; r < 5; r++) {\n        const points = [];\n        const z = (r - 2) * 1.85;\n\n        points.push(new THREE.Vector3(-5.8, 0.08, z));\n        points.push(new THREE.Vector3(-2.2, 0.08, z + Math.sin(r) * 0.6));\n        points.push(new THREE.Vector3(1.5, 0.08, z - Math.cos(r) * 0.45));\n        points.push(new THREE.Vector3(5.4, 0.08, z));\n\n        const routeGeometry = new THREE.BufferGeometry().setFromPoints(points);\n        const line = new THREE.Line(routeGeometry, routeMaterial);\n        group.add(line);\n      }\n\n      // Subtle blue cross routes\n      const blueRouteMaterial = new THREE.LineBasicMaterial({\n        color: 0x4DA3FF,\n        transparent: true,\n        opacity: 0.16\n      });\n\n      for (let r = 0; r < 4; r++) {\n        const points = [];\n        const x = (r - 1.5) * 2.1;\n\n        points.push(new THREE.Vector3(x, 0.1, -5.7));\n        points.push(new THREE.Vector3(x + Math.sin(r) * 0.5, 0.1, -1.8));\n        points.push(new THREE.Vector3(x - Math.cos(r) * 0.4, 0.1, 1.8));\n        points.push(new THREE.Vector3(x, 0.1, 5.4));\n\n        const routeGeometry = new THREE.BufferGeometry().setFromPoints(points);\n        const line = new THREE.Line(routeGeometry, blueRouteMaterial);\n        group.add(line);\n      }\n\n      const clock = new THREE.Clock();\n\n      function animate() {\n        requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n\n        const elapsedTime = clock.getElapsedTime();\n\n        columnMaterial.uniforms.uTime.value = elapsedTime;\n\n        group.children.forEach((child) => {\n          if (child.isMesh) {\n            child.position.y =\n              Math.sin(elapsedTime * child.userData.speed + child.userData.phase) * 0.32;\n          }\n        });\n\n        group.rotation.y = elapsedTime * 0.045;\n\n        renderer.render(scene, camera);\n      }\n\n      animate();\n\n      window.addEventListener('resize', () => {\n        if (!container) return;\n\n        camera.aspect = container.clientWidth / container.clientHeight;\n        camera.updateProjectionMatrix();\n\n        renderer.setSize(container.clientWidth, container.clientHeight);\n      });\n    }\n  </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "nexus-framework.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/staff-featured-2026-05-22/nexus-framework.jpg", "source_name": "nexus-framework-DESIGN.md", "views": 108, "forks": 2, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "66a84ecf-0972-40f3-8a4c-15b11d3aee0a", "created_at": "2026-06-12T07:38:10.793894+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T15:42:39.219228+00:00"}